{"speciesId":329,"names":{"fr":"Vibraninf","es":"Vibrava","en":"Vibrava","ja":"ビブラーバ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"To make prey faint, VIBRAVA generates ultrasonic waves by vigorously making its two wings vibrate. This POKéMON’s ultrasonic waves are so powerful, they can bring on headaches in people."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"VIBRAVA’s wings have not yet completed the process of growing. Rather than flying long distances, they are more useful for generating ultrasonic waves by vibrating."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It looses ultrasonic waves by rubbing its wings together. Since a VIBRAVA’s wings are still in the process of growing, it can only fly short distances."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It generates ultrasonic waves by violently flapping its wings. After making its prey faint, it melts the prey with acid."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It generates ultrasonic waves by violently flapping its wings. After making its prey faint, it melts the prey with acid."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It violently shudders its wings, generating ultrasonic waves to induce headaches in people."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It violently shudders its wings, generating ultrasonic waves to induce headaches in people."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It violently shudders its wings, generating ultrasonic waves to induce headaches in people."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It vibrates its wings vigorously, creating ultrasonic waves that cause serious headaches."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It vibrates its wings vigorously, creating ultrasonic waves that cause serious headaches."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Ses violents battements d’ailes génèrent des vagues d’ultrasons qui donnent mal au crâne."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It violently shudders its wings, generating ultrasonic waves to induce headaches in people."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Ses violents battements d’ailes génèrent des vagues d’ultrasons qui donnent mal au crâne."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It violently shudders its wings, generating ultrasonic waves to induce headaches in people."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"The ultrasonic waves it generates by rubbing its two wings together cause severe headaches."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"The ultrasonic waves it generates by rubbing its two wings together cause severe headaches."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ses violents battements d’ailes génèrent des vagues d’ultrasons qui donnent d’intenses migraines."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Al agitar a gran velocidad ambas alas, emite ondas ultrasónicas que provocan fuertes dolores de cabeza."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"The ultrasonic waves it generates by rubbing its two wings together cause severe headaches."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"２枚の 羽を 高速で 振動させて 出す 超音波は 激しい 頭痛を ひきおこす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il génère des ondes ultrasoniques en battant violemment des ailes. Dès que sa proie est inconsciente, il l’arrose d’acide pour pouvoir l’avaler."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Genera ondas ultrasónicas batiendo las alas violentamente. Cuando debilita a su presa, la destruye con ácido."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It generates ultrasonic waves by violently flapping its wings. After making its prey faint, it melts the prey with acid."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"羽を 激しく 振動させて 超音波を 発生。気絶した 獲物を 消化液で 溶かす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Pour mettre ses proies K.O., Vibraninf envoie des ultrasons en faisant vibrer ses deux ailes. Les ondes sonores de ce Pokémon sont si puissantes qu’elles peuvent déclencher des maux de tête chez les gens."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Para debilitar a su víctima, Vibrava genera ondas ultrasónicas haciendo vibrar con fuerza las alas. Las ondas que crea son tan fuertes que pueden dar dolor de cabeza a la gente."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"To make prey faint, Vibrava generates ultrasonic waves by vigorously making its two wings vibrate. This Pokémon’s ultrasonic waves are so powerful, they can bring on headaches in people."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"２枚の ハネを 激しく 振動させて 超音波を 出し 獲物を 気絶させる。 人間も 頭痛を 起こす ほどの 威力。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Les ailes de Vibraninf n’ont pas complètement fini de pousser. Elles ne lui servent pas à voler sur de longues distances, mais plutôt à générer des ultrasons en vibrant."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Vibrava no ha desarrollado las alas del todo. Más que para volar y recorrer largas distancias, le resultan útiles para generar ondas ultrasónicas al hacer que vibren."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Vibrava’s wings have not yet completed the process of growing. Rather than flying long distances, they are more useful for generating ultrasonic waves by vibrating."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"ビブラーバの ハネは まだ 成長途中。 長い 距離を 飛ぶ よりも 振動させて 超音波を 出す ほうが 得意なのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Ses ébauches d’ailes ne lui servent pas tant à voler qu’à produire des ultrasons par frottement pour neutraliser ses ennemis."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Las alas de Vibrava están subdesarrolladas. Más que para volar, las utiliza para crear ondas ultrasónicas con las que ataca a sus enemigos."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"Rather than using its underdeveloped wings for flight, it rubs them together, producing ultrasonic waves to attack its enemies."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"未熟な ハネは 飛ぶことよりも 擦って 超音波を 発生させ 敵を 攻撃するのに 使う。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Pour aider ses ailes à pousser, il fait un vrai carnage tous les jours, arrosant ses moult proies d’acide pour les dissoudre et s’en nourrir."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Para terminar de desarrollar sus alas, se nutre a diario de un gran número de presas, a las que disuelve con ácido antes de devorarlas."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"To help make its wings grow, it dissolves quantities of prey in its digestive juices and guzzles them down every day."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"ハネを 成長 させるために 毎日 大量の 獲物を 消化液で 溶かして すする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il émet des ultrasons avec ses ailes pour assommer ses proies, puis les ensable vivantes pour les conserver."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Emite ondas ultrasónicas cuando hace vibrar sus alas. Entierra bajo la arena a las presas que ha dejado inconscientes para conservarlas."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It vibrates its wings to generate ultrasonic waves, causing its prey to faint. Then it buries the prey alive in the sand to preserve it."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"ハネを 振動させ 超音波を 放つ。 気絶した 獲物を 砂の 中に 生き埋めにして 保存する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il émet de puissantes ondes sonores en battant des ailes, aussi est-il recommandé à son Dresseur de se protéger les tympans."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Genera raras ondas sónicas batiendo las alas. El estruendo es tal que sus Entrenadores necesitan tapones para los oídos."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It vibrates its wings to send out odd sound waves. Trainers who are with it need earplugs."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"ハネを 振動させ 音波を 発生させる。 一緒に いる トレーナーは 耳栓が 必要。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Ses violents battements d’ailes génèrent des vagues d’ultrasons qui donnent des migraines intenses."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Al agitar sus alas a gran velocidad, emite ondas ultrasónicas que provocan fuertes dolores de cabeza."